{"games":[{"id":83082757540223,"name":"(UPD) Find the Brainrot (191)","desc":"In this game you search for Brainrots that are hidden in the map.. 🗺️\n\nUpdate 29 is out now!\n\n🔎 There are currently 304 Brainrots to find!\n\n💪 Complete Obbies and Quizzes with your friends and others!\n\n♥️ Thank you for playing!\n\nThis is a fan-made game inspired by Steal a Brainrot!\nCredits to the original Creators of Steal a Brainrot.","path":"/game/83082757540223-find-the-brainrot","slug":"83082757540223-find-the-brainrot","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/54a8fcde0183e2ab3bad6d6a969b0edc27bd78b84d7ab3f448d0217c720a7e18.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-8d440171bd43ca4a677b41d743b7b766/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":1,"visitor":14850449,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-11-24T04:56:55.334Z","creator":{"name":"FunFindTheGames","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":77257349493567,"name":"[V1.3] Fruit Piece Incremental ","desc":"⚔️FRUIT PIECE INCREMENTAL ⚔️\n\nA text-based adventure inspired by one piece!\n\nGain a devil fruit for each major boss you kill!\n\n🏴‍☠️20+ STORY ARCS!\nRomance Dawn to Laugh Tale — battle Crocodile, Doflamingo, Kaido, Blackbeard & more.\n\n⚓JOIN THE GROUP FOR BONUSES!\n\n🍎COUNTLESS DEVIL FRUITS\nRoll across 6 rarities. Rubber, Fire, Thunder, Buddha, Divine Wolf all with unique mechanics and skills\n\n👊MASTER HAKI\nDozens of levels. Specialize in Armament, Observation, or Conqueror's.\n\n🩸BLOODLINES\nMeditate, earn scrolls, unlock power — from Noble Blood to the mythical D. Clan.\n\n🎣FISHING\nCast for rare loot, Devil Fruit Rolls & Ancient-tier catches.\n\n👥RECRUIT BOSSES\nBuild your crew! Recruit powerful bosses to aid you\n\n⭐Favorite so you don't miss updates!\n\nThis game is in alpha, so expect some minor bugs & join the group to report any problems!","path":"/game/77257349493567-fruit-piece-incremental","slug":"77257349493567-fruit-piece-incremental","thumbnail":{"url":